{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L1RoZSUyME11c2ljJTIwQm94JTIwJTI4MjAxOCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Music Box","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/h2SEFrLRR2zIUJF6PA8CkuFOWc4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ikQTCv0EftIfU7IPhrMDZ3lUijy.jpg","description":"When six-year-old Sophie is tragically orphaned guardianship is assigned to her estranged aunt Annabelle. The two move into a large, eerie, Victorian house where Sophie unearths a locked wooden box with a strange symbol drawn on it. Desperate to connect with her niece Annabelle pries the lock open revealing a beautiful music box. Each time the music box is wound and replayed it's surprisingly chilling melody plays slightly longer, captivating Sophie even more. When the music box begins affecting Sophie's behavior and health Annabelle seeks the aid of a child psychologist and clairvoyant who soon discover the music box is possessed by an evil spirit who seeks to haunt Sophie and destroy Annabelle. As the haunting intensifies time begins to run out and Annabelle finds herself racing against the music box's melody to defeat the spirit before the last note plays.\n\nReleased 27 Jul 2018 · Italy · Language: English · 83 min\nStudio: Ghost Film Pictures, Real Dreams Entertainment S.r.l., ITN Distribution\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.3","runtime":"83 min","cast":["Rachel Daigh","Antonio Lujak","Antonella Salvucci","Cearl Pepper","Fiona Whitelaw","Melissa Leone","Anita Tenerelli"],"director":["John Real"],"released":"2018-07-27T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Hear no evil.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"John Real","character":"Director"},{"name":"Rachel Daigh","character":"Annabelle"},{"name":"Antonio Lujak","character":"Loris","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ggrKA5kKrv0Yy4LvcfVPczOvh2K.jpg"},{"name":"Antonella Salvucci","character":"Eva","photo":"https://image.t